package home

templ projectSetup() {
	<div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mb-12 border border-base-300">
		<div class="card-body p-4 sm:p-8">
			<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
				<div class="badge badge-primary badge-lg font-bold text-white">1</div>
				<h3 id="project-setup" class="card-title text-2xl">Setting Up Your Project</h3>
			</div>

			<div class="prose max-w-none">
				<p>We provide official SDKs for multiple languages that handle the underlying network protocols, serialization, and game loop timing. We highly recommend using one of these SDKs so you can focus purely on your bot's algorithmic design.</p>
				<ul>
				    <li><a class="link link-primary" href="/docs/GolangSDK">Golang SDK Tutorial</a></li>
				    <li><a class="link link-primary" href="/docs/PythonSDK">Python SDK Tutorial</a></li>
				    <li><a class="link link-primary" href="/docs/TypeScriptSDK">TypeScript SDK Tutorial</a></li>
				    <li><a class="link link-primary" href="/docs/RustSDK">Rust SDK Tutorial</a></li>
				</ul>
				<p>Simply follow the respective tutorial to initialize a new project and install the SDK package.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
}
